  "packageHash": "XGs59dMesFrPHiloekMaIrQTDrC8noVqK11q6SEjI7CT50UEQoXDNS2sq6m/Sr9Bs2qD9D2nq736kEGbZBFjkA==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 376731,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/art-ix/picturesharp.jxl",
  "published": "2026-11-02T12:13:05.893Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.13: Image.OpenFrameReaderAsync reads JPEG XL frame by frame through the frame reader SPI of PictureSharp 0.9.1 (now the minimum version). Frames, durations, pixel type, loop count and metadata equal those of Image.Load; MaxPixels needs to allow only one canvas, MaxFrames counts every stored frame, the compressed input is buffered within MaxInputBytes, and working memory stays a few canvases. FirstFrameOnly, cancellation between and inside frames and disposal at any point are supported. Image.Load is unchanged. See docs/releases/release-0.8.13.md and docs/design/0.8.13-frame-reader.md.",
